"The sender receives a message with the date and time of delivery. The cost of the service is 10 rubles.\n"
"The sender receives an SMS with information about the date/time of delivery and the recipient's full name. For warehouse delivery mode and when specifying the recipient's mobile phone, CDEK provides all clients with a free service: \"SMS notification of cargo arrival at the warehouse\" or notifications as PUSH messages in the CDEK mobile app or in messengers. The recipient will receive a message with information about the pickup address and office hours."
